Linux 7.3-rc3 -> 7.3-rc6 incremental update

Mainline diff v7.3-rc3..v7.3-rc6 from
https://git.kernel.org/torvalds/p/v7.3-rc6/v7.3-rc3
applied on top of Jens's 7.3-rc3 integration (3f0d8691afa0).

This upstream range contains the QRTR resume hello fix (6a5719cc3ef2) and the
X1E interconnect QoS revert, so the former local patches for those were dropped.

Conflict resolutions against Jens's tree:
- drivers/thunderbolt/tb.c: forward declaration of tb_dp_tunnel_active()
  placed after Jens's extra tb_queue_dp_bandwidth_request() prototype.
- drivers/remoteproc/qcom_q6v5_pas.c: 9db31edf92dd ("Fix error masking in
  qcom_pas_stop()") adapted to Jens's qcom_pas_select_shutdown() lite-PAS
  call. 34b8b2d78b62 ("Don't enable handover IRQ on attach") is not applied:
  Jens moves attach into qcom_q6v5_attach(), whose handover IRQ
  enable/disable is already guarded against unbalanced enables.

